flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[/Visitor types an email and<br/>a password on the Log in page/]
  R1((1)) --> A
  A --> B{Both<br/>typed?}
  B -->|No| B1[/Please type your email<br/>and password/] --> R2((1))
  B -->|Yes| C[POST /api/auth/login,<br/>40 tries per 15 minutes]
  C --> D{Email found,<br/>password right?}
  D -->|No| D1[/401: email or<br/>password is wrong/] --> R3((1))
  D -->|Yes| E{Email<br/>confirmed?}
  E -->|No| F{A minute since<br/>the last code?}
  F -->|Yes| F1[Make and send<br/>a fresh code] --> G
  F -->|No| G[/403: open the<br/>Verify Email page/]
  G --> X([End])
  E -->|Yes| H[Sign a token for 7 days,<br/>set the httpOnly cookie,<br/>AuthContext keeps the user]
  H --> I{Came from a<br/>member page?}
  I -->|Yes| I1[/Go back to that page/] --> X
  I -->|No| I2[/Open the Dashboard/] --> X
